    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188400/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.poster.avif?t=1752968004\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188400/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.webm?t=1752968004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188400/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.mp4?t=1752968004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WARRIOR SPIRIT\u2122 is an innovative single-player 3D Action-Adventure Platformer unlike anything else.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188400/extras/28ce8eddd180cad66b31aa0ab28da3f1.poster.avif?t=1752968004\" aria-label=\"WARRIOR SPIRIT movement\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188400/extras/28ce8eddd180cad66b31aa0ab28da3f1.webm?t=1752968004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188400/extras/28ce8eddd180cad66b31aa0ab28da3f1.mp4?t=1752968004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a Clay Machine created to destroy evil clay monsters. Combine the four Arms of Good with a diverse set of clay materials to swing, bounce, wall-run and dash through the four corners of the land, each a giant area to explore.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is your charge to bring the will of Good to bear against the monsters of evil and use unique tools to pinch, smash and slice your way to victory.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your style, with multiple paths through levels; using motion to speed to the exit, or take time to explore the many puzzles of the world, and collect sand dollars to spend on additional clay items.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Tools of WARRIOR SPIRIT.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188400/extras/761d5cd9bf09aaeb1093536463e8486e.poster.avif?t=1752968004\" aria-label=\"Four Arms of WARRIOR SPIRIT\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188400/extras/761d5cd9bf09aaeb1093536463e8486e.webm?t=1752968004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188400/extras/761d5cd9bf09aaeb1093536463e8486e.mp4?t=1752968004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">WARRIOR SPIRIT\u2019s Helmet of Good provides multiple Arms, each with their own unique moves and tools. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The White Arm can grab all sorts of things, like clay to bounce, swing, and climb. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Red Arm wields The Cutter of Good, which slices clay. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Blue Arm holds The Needle of Good, which pinches clay. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Yellow Arm commands The Mallet of Good, which smashes clay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Defeat the monsters of evil.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188400/extras/25b16c8fca70b80aec02754798b025ce.poster.avif?t=1752968004\" aria-label=\"Corners of the Land in WARRIOR SPIRIT\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188400/extras/25b16c8fca70b80aec02754798b025ce.webm?t=1752968004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188400/extras/25b16c8fca70b80aec02754798b025ce.mp4?t=1752968004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The monsters are running amok across the land. Each unique type has its own weakness to the different Arms of Good. Defeating them can leave you with useful clay tools. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Master your environment.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188400/extras/c151d8d9cd450a584cabd18d86893b39.poster.avif?t=1752968004\" aria-label=\"Clay Tools of WARRIOR SPIRIT\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188400/extras/c151d8d9cd450a584cabd18d86893b39.webm?t=1752968004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188400/extras/c151d8d9cd450a584cabd18d86893b39.mp4?t=1752968004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">WARRIOR SPIRIT can use the particular properties of clay to traverse the world and solve puzzles.  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bounce clay reaches higher heights.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hard clay provides a platform for scaling walls. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sticky clay can swing away from danger.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Life clay restores valuable life.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Huge open world</strong> \u2013 Four unique corners of the world to explore. From the glass-ridden desert, to the schoolhouse jungle \u2013 the opulent sea tower, to the factory of clay. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play your way</strong> \u2013 Test your skills and dash for the objective, or take a step back and survey the many puzzle platformer challenges across the world. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Never blame your tools</strong> \u2013 Zoom over bodies of water, bounce up ledges, swing from vines or speed across walls with the traversal tools at your disposal. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Go toe-to-toe</strong> \u2013 Test your combat skills and wield the Arms of Good against a host of evil monsters, each with different strengths and weaknesses. </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188400/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.poster.avif?t=1752968004\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188400/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.webm?t=1752968004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188400/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.mp4?t=1752968004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WARRIOR SPIRIT\u2122 is an innovative single-player 3D Action-Adventure Platformer unlike anything else.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188400/extras/28ce8eddd180cad66b31aa0ab28da3f1.poster.avif?t=1752968004\" aria-label=\"WARRIOR SPIRIT movement\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188400/extras/28ce8eddd180cad66b31aa0ab28da3f1.webm?t=1752968004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188400/extras/28ce8eddd180cad66b31aa0ab28da3f1.mp4?t=1752968004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a Clay Machine created to destroy evil clay monsters. Combine the four Arms of Good with a diverse set of clay materials to swing, bounce, wall-run and dash through the four corners of the land, each a giant area to explore.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is your charge to bring the will of Good to bear against the monsters of evil and use unique tools to pinch, smash and slice your way to victory.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your style, with multiple paths through levels; using motion to speed to the exit, or take time to explore the many puzzles of the world, and collect sand dollars to spend on additional clay items.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Tools of WARRIOR SPIRIT.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188400/extras/761d5cd9bf09aaeb1093536463e8486e.poster.avif?t=1752968004\" aria-label=\"Four Arms of WARRIOR SPIRIT\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188400/extras/761d5cd9bf09aaeb1093536463e8486e.webm?t=1752968004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188400/extras/761d5cd9bf09aaeb1093536463e8486e.mp4?t=1752968004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">WARRIOR SPIRIT\u2019s Helmet of Good provides multiple Arms, each with their own unique moves and tools. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The White Arm can grab all sorts of things, like clay to bounce, swing, and climb. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Red Arm wields The Cutter of Good, which slices clay. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Blue Arm holds The Needle of Good, which pinches clay. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Yellow Arm commands The Mallet of Good, which smashes clay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Defeat the monsters of evil.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188400/extras/25b16c8fca70b80aec02754798b025ce.poster.avif?t=1752968004\" aria-label=\"Corners of the Land in WARRIOR SPIRIT\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188400/extras/25b16c8fca70b80aec02754798b025ce.webm?t=1752968004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188400/extras/25b16c8fca70b80aec02754798b025ce.mp4?t=1752968004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The monsters are running amok across the land. Each unique type has its own weakness to the different Arms of Good. Defeating them can leave you with useful clay tools. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Master your environment.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188400/extras/c151d8d9cd450a584cabd18d86893b39.poster.avif?t=1752968004\" aria-label=\"Clay Tools of WARRIOR SPIRIT\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188400/extras/c151d8d9cd450a584cabd18d86893b39.webm?t=1752968004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188400/extras/c151d8d9cd450a584cabd18d86893b39.mp4?t=1752968004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">WARRIOR SPIRIT can use the particular properties of clay to traverse the world and solve puzzles.  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bounce clay reaches higher heights.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hard clay provides a platform for scaling walls. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sticky clay can swing away from danger.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Life clay restores valuable life.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Huge open world</strong> \u2013 Four unique corners of the world to explore. From the glass-ridden desert, to the schoolhouse jungle \u2013 the opulent sea tower, to the factory of clay. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play your way</strong> \u2013 Test your skills and dash for the objective, or take a step back and survey the many puzzle platformer challenges across the world. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Never blame your tools</strong> \u2013 Zoom over bodies of water, bounce up ledges, swing from vines or speed across walls with the traversal tools at your disposal. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Go toe-to-toe</strong> \u2013 Test your combat skills and wield the Arms of Good against a host of evil monsters, each with different strengths and weaknesses. </p></li></ul>",
